# The repo is authored on Windows but every script, config and Dockerfile in it
# executes inside a Linux container. CRLF would break the Makefile and shell
# entrypoints, so normalise to LF regardless of the checkout platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.parquet binary
*.onnx binary
